// Give the audio HAL its own soong namespace.
//
// Added for device/sony/pdx246. Without this file, audio/ inherits the
// namespace declared at hardware/qcom-caf/sm8450-6.6/Android.bp, which also
// covers display/, dataipa/ and data-ipa-cfg-mgr/. Importing that namespace to
// get the QTI AIDL audio HAL therefore also makes 21 display and 3 IPA module
// names visible, every one of which collides with a pdx246 vendor blob --
// build/soong/fsgen/fsgen_mutators.go:378 rejects a module name that resolves
// in two imported namespaces, with no per-module override.
//
// NameResolver.findNamespace() searches upward for the nearest ancestor
// namespace (build/soong/android/namespace.go:180), so declaring one here takes
// audio/ out of the parent namespace and leaves display/ and the IPA trees
// invisible -- pdx246 keeps its working display blobs and still gets the audio
// HAL from source.
//
// No imports: every external reference from audio/ resolves in the global
// namespace (checked across all 48 Android.bp files under audio/).
soong_namespace {
}
